{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00213",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 3.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Okay, welcome. Let's see what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.38,
      "end_seconds": 5.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.52,
      "end_seconds": 9.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.24,
      "end_seconds": 13.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Not great, I ended up a few streets away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.26,
      "end_seconds": 17.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "So, what's been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.49,
      "end_seconds": 20.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I've been dealing with blood on the toilet paper."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.4,
      "end_seconds": 27.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "When did you first notice it? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.74,
      "end_seconds": 39.85,
      "duration_seconds": 12.11,
      "text": "I've had it for two days. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.13,
      "end_seconds": 47.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "Right. Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.66,
      "end_seconds": 55.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. It's worse with hard stools. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.26,
      "end_seconds": 59.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Alright, does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.09,
      "end_seconds": 69.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "Pain when I pass stool goes along with it, most of the time. With pain when I pass stool, pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.62,
      "end_seconds": 76.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any family history of bowel cancer or change in bowel habit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.01,
      "end_seconds": 83.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "No family history of bowel cancer or change in bowel habit, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.26,
      "end_seconds": 88.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.71,
      "end_seconds": 101.44,
      "duration_seconds": 11.73,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.65,
      "end_seconds": 108.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.2,
      "end_seconds": 113.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.75,
      "end_seconds": 120.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "Alright, what medicines are you taking at the moment? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.91,
      "end_seconds": 123.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I'm on Anovate cream, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.75,
      "end_seconds": 131.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.61,
      "end_seconds": 134.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.76,
      "end_seconds": 137.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.38,
      "end_seconds": 142.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Yes, latex. I get a rash on my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.34,
      "end_seconds": 146.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "So, one moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.36,
      "end_seconds": 147.12,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.67,
      "end_seconds": 165.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.01,
      "end_seconds": 168.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.42,
      "end_seconds": 174.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.03,
      "end_seconds": 175.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.73,
      "end_seconds": 178.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.15,
      "end_seconds": 195.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Tummy is soft and non-tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.67,
      "end_seconds": 197.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.5,
      "end_seconds": 215.49,
      "duration_seconds": 14.99,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.87,
      "end_seconds": 217.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.47,
      "end_seconds": 229.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with haemorrhoids at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.6,
      "end_seconds": 233.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.46,
      "end_seconds": 255.15,
      "duration_seconds": 20.69,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's haemorrhoids, and we'll know more once the a colonoscopy is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had blood on the toilet paper for two days, mild, and no change in bowel habit or family history of bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.54,
      "end_seconds": 258.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "That's it, uh, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.17,
      "end_seconds": 282.42,
      "duration_seconds": 22.25,
      "text": "I'm going to order a colonoscopy, for rectal bleeding. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'd like you to take a soothing cream, twice a day, for one week. That's for haemorrhoids. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Soak in a warm bath for ten minutes after you pass stool, and don't strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.76,
      "end_seconds": 301.9,
      "duration_seconds": 18.14,
      "text": "Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. I'll also refer you to a colorectal surgeon. Please don't sit on it if you pass a lot of blood or feel faint. That's the point to get seen urgently. Please come and see me after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.6,
      "end_seconds": 305.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Okay, so okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.82,
      "end_seconds": 310.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.43,
      "end_seconds": 316.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.58,
      "end_seconds": 322.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.11,
      "end_seconds": 326.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}